{"id":"n58818-1-5","stage":4,"title":"병명 · 病名","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58818-1-5-1","ko":"너희 아버지께서 편찮으시다더니 병명은 밝혀졌니?","zh":"听说你父亲病了，查出是什么病了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너희","meaning":"你们","explanation":"너희：你们","readings":[{"term":"너희","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61180","senseId":"2","lemma":"너희","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아버지께서","meaning":"父亲，爸爸","explanation":"아버지：父亲，爸爸；께서：이/가 的敬语形式，标记受到尊敬的主语。","readings":[{"term":"아버지","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71343","senseId":"2","lemma":"아버지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"편찮으시다더니","meaning":"不适，不舒服","explanation":"편찮다：不适，不舒服；으시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；다더니：引用以前听到的话，再说明后来的发现或结果。","readings":[{"term":"편찮다","audio":"/audio/6ec04ef1c8d756903863.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87901","senseId":"1","lemma":"편찮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"병명은","meaning":"病名","explanation":"병명：病名；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"병명","audio":"/audio/9fe46cddc5da62b0b8cf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58818","senseId":"1","lemma":"병명","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"밝혀졌니?","meaning":"查明；表示成为前面表达的那样。","explanation":"밝히다：查明；지다：表示成为前面表达的那样。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"밝히다","audio":"/audio/05491efb4d6e2bc679ff.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58174","senseId":"5","lemma":"밝히다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"2","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba","term":"너희","zh":"你们","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3","entryId":"61180","definition":"指代包括听者在内的多数人，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너히"]},{"id":"af4870c15b98485b","term":"아버지","zh":"父亲，爸爸","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3","entryId":"71343","definition":"在与子女有关的事情上用于指称或称呼有子女的男子。","pronunciation":["아버지"]},{"id":"6ec04ef1c8d75690","term":"편찮다","zh":"不适，不舒服","audio":"/audio/6ec04ef1c8d756903863.mp3","entryId":"87901","definition":"身体或内心不痛快或难受。","pronunciation":["편찬타"]},{"id":"9fe46cddc5da62b0","term":"병명","zh":"病名","audio":"/audio/9fe46cddc5da62b0b8cf.mp3","entryId":"58818","definition":"病的名称。","pronunciation":["병ː명"]},{"id":"05491efb4d6e2bc6","term":"밝히다","zh":"查明","audio":"/audio/05491efb4d6e2bc679ff.mp3","entryId":"58174","definition":"弄清楚某个事实、价值或是非曲直。","pronunciation":["발키다"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的那样。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的那样。","pronunciation":["지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c5d75165906de62ac107.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n58818-1-5-2","ko":"응. 병원에서 위암이래.","zh":"嗯，医院说是胃癌。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"병원에서","meaning":"医院","explanation":"병원：医院；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"병원","audio":"/audio/4f4c2d79c47ca512edb7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62271","senseId":"1","lemma":"병원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"위암이래.","meaning":"胃癌","explanation":"위암：胃癌；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；래：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"위암","audio":"/audio/5240a0738e22a9789d42.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69599","senseId":"1","lemma":"위암","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"4f4c2d79c47ca512","term":"병원","zh":"医院","audio":"/audio/4f4c2d79c47ca512edb7.mp3","entryId":"62271","definition":"具备相关设施、由医生和护士治疗病人的地方。","pronunciation":["병ː원"]},{"id":"5240a0738e22a978","term":"위암","zh":"胃癌","audio":"/audio/5240a0738e22a9789d42.mp3","entryId":"69599","definition":"长在胃部的癌。","pronunciation":["위암"]}],"audio":"/audio/5c677f5a9001edad4d30.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.598,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=58818","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":129,"sequenceScore":2.4247,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯，医院说是胃癌。","裤子怎么全撕坏了？","听说你父亲病了，查出是什么病了吗？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["嗯，医院说是胃癌。","听说你父亲病了，查出是什么病了吗？","裤子怎么全撕坏了？"],"answer":0}]}
